<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Motors Sept output up 0.9% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Motors Sept output up 0.9% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp said on Friday its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas output in September were as follows:</p>
<p> Production	  114,364   up    0.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		73,130   down  5.0 percent</p>
<p>  - Trucks &amp; Buses  41,234   up   13.4 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales     76,885   down  1.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		35,161   down 16.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Trucks &amp; Buses  41,724   up   17.2 percent</p>
<p> Exports		47,247   up   21.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		32,739   up   23.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     14,508   up   15.6 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output    66,404   up   10.1 percent</p>
</text>
